    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 10th level, the blue mage can analyze a creature to find how much (current) hit points, (current) magic points, damage reduction, any resistances, and any weaknesses it possesses. A creature can resist the effects by making a Will save (DC 10 + half of the blue mage's level + her Intelligence modifier). This ability has a range of 60 feet and requires a move action which doesn't provoke attacks of opportunity. This ability can be used a number of times per day equal to 3 + her Intelligence modifier.</p>",
